<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="892745297"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:08.040"><div begin="13.880" end="39.296" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.880" end="17.804" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.880" end="14.671">买了</span><span begin="14.671" end="15.014">球</span><span begin="15.014" end="15.480">鞋</span><span begin="15.480" end="15.943">再</span><span begin="15.943" end="16.326">买</span><span begin="16.326" end="16.680">玩</span><span begin="16.680" end="17.804">具</span></p><p begin="19.150" end="25.925" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.150" end="19.892">甚至</span><span begin="19.892" end="20.847">想</span> <span begin="22.474" end="23.002">花</span><span begin="23.002" end="23.420">光</span><span begin="23.420" end="23.655">一</span><span begin="23.655" end="24.255">切</span><span begin="24.255" end="24.639">买</span><span begin="24.639" end="24.955">新</span><span begin="24.955" end="25.925">居</span></p><p begin="27.127" end="31.259" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.127" end="28.055">爱上</span><span begin="28.055" end="28.290">谈</span><span begin="28.290" end="28.856">情</span><span begin="28.856" end="29.689">再爱</span><span begin="29.689" end="29.956">入</span><span begin="29.956" end="31.259">睡</span></p><p begin="32.494" end="39.296" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.494" end="33.180">直到</span><span begin="33.180" end="34.255">想</span> <span begin="35.817" end="36.748">躺进</span><span begin="36.748" end="37.531">陌生</span><span begin="37.531" end="37.914">者</span><span begin="37.914" end="38.199">的</span><span begin="38.199" end="38.649">家</span><span begin="38.649" end="39.296">里</span></p></div><div begin="40.409" end="56.608" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="40.409" end="45.590" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.409" end="41.319">你我</span><span begin="41.319" end="41.719">永</span><span begin="41.719" end="42.087">远</span><span begin="42.087" end="42.355">不</span><span begin="42.355" end